\lim_{r\rightarrow\infty,p\rightarrow 1}(\frac{\lambda}{r+\lambda})^x = \lim_{r\rightarrow\infty,p\rightarrow 1}\lambda^x\frac{1}{(r+\lambda)^x} = \lambda^k(r(1+\frac{\lambda}{r}))^{-k} = & \frac{\lambda^k}{r^k}(1+\frac{\lambda}{r})^{-k}\\
